374	/**
375	 * `?env05=1` (Screen 05 only, visual): one band ring at tunnel coordinate s whose points are displaced sideways exactly
376	 * like the warped wall (`TubeGeoOptions.warp`, same (s, th) convention), so the band keeps sitting on the wall. Same
377	 * placement / basis as buildRingsAt with `band` (−right, up, tan), as a one-instance InstancedMesh so every ring
